 ## Quick Start
 
+```python
+from aspose.email_foss import msg
+message = msg.MapiMessage.create('Test', 'Body')
+message.set_property(msg.PropertyId.SUBJECT, 'Test Subject')
+message.add_recipient('user@example.com')
+message.save('test.msg')
+```
